# Portfolio Creative Source (Fixed)

Use this rule when the user wants creative studio direction.

Source of truth:
- `portfolio-template-creative-studio.md`

Requirements:
1. Always read `portfolio-template-creative-studio.md` before generating output.
2. Keep the same ASCII template structure.
3. Write all output in English only.
4. Prioritize visual storytelling, interaction quality, and project showcase.
5. Keep personal information secondary to strengths, projects, and technical execution.
6. Do not switch to enterprise source unless the user explicitly asks to disable this mode.
